• AO2: Apply knowledge and understanding of citizenship concepts, terms and issues to

contexts and actions.

• AO3: Analyse and evaluate a range of evidence relating to citizenship issues, debates and
actions, including different viewpoints, to develop reasoned, coherent arguments and make
substantiated judgements.

