  "text": "Which one of the following best describes a political party?\nA) A group that campaigns on a single issue without fielding candidates\nB) An organisation that contests elections aiming to form a government\nC) A body that provides legal advice to the government\nD) A committee that approves parliamentary legislation",
  "type": "1 mark — Multiple Choice",
  "marks": "1 mark for B) An organisation that contests elections aiming to form a government."
 },
