  "text": "Which of the following best describes a 'primary source' in a citizenship action investigation?\nA) A report written by a government department about the issue\nB) A newspaper article covering a related campaign\nC) A survey you designed and carried out yourself to gather data on the issue\nD) A book written by an academic about the topic",
  "type": "1 mark — Multiple Choice",
  "marks": "C) A survey you designed and carried out yourself to gather data on the issue [1 mark]"
 },
 {
